SUPPORT
-------
If a review fails or produces an error, check:
- The proposal and context fields are not empty
- Uploaded files are under 10MB each
- File types are supported (PDF, TXT, MD, PY, JS, JSON, CSV, YAML)
- Your session has not expired (sign out and back in)

For deployment issues, check the uvicorn terminal for error output.